{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381940/extras/771cc1f2fa8bf91f02e5f09c1646b58f.avif?t=1769511932\" width=548 height=160 /></span>Brutally Brutally Difficult Score Attack Breakout/Pinball type videogame with Sensory Overloading Surreal Aesthetic and a Totally Awesome Soundtrack! <br><br>Player must keep track of two eyes simultaneously with their advance perception and high functioning cognition while attempting to Gather points and collect an\u00a0 accumulated score and attempting to exit stage before failing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >23 Unique Stages </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 Large Tower Stage </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four Modes: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Consecutive Mode  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Marathon Mode  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Tower Mode  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Solo Stage Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather points and collect accumulated score by attempting to exit stage before failing. <br>   <br>\u00a0Learn when to boost and when not to boost</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accumulate Score without failing.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Crazy Eye must enter the goal to collect score.<br><br><br>1. When an eye enters the goal</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the stage run finishes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >try not to enter the goal too soon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >hold back and take risks for more points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Press the &quot;space bar&quot; to charge </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the VHS TAPE paddle </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >to multiply your potential score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the charge only lasts for a split second,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >so timing is required to achieve this.<br><br>3. Use Left Flipper with &quot;S&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use RIGHT Flipper with &quot;ENTER&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set the Position of each flipper Strategically </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >by Rapidly Pressing &quot;S&quot; or &quot;ENTER&quot;.<br><br>4. Move the VHS tape paddle with &quot;a&quot; or &quot;d&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >to rebound the crazy eyes,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >block crazy eyes, or</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >get out of the way of the crazy eyes.<br><br>5. Press &quot;P&quot; at your own risk</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >to multiply your potential score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >pressing &quot;p&quot; causes both crazy eyes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > to pick up speed</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >rapidly.<br><br>6. Pressing &quot;p&quot; can be used</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >when a crazy eye is stagnant or too slow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Pressing &quot;p&quot; strategically is crucial.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Total Insanity","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3381940/7053d1480113d82c674c55c7a0888c1a9de8973d.jpg"},{"name":"Sore Eye","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3381940/29b8d592f1fcf49d3d50e457828590f4481d7877.jpg"},{"name":"Eye Gunk","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3381940/3dc9f124ca38f9ebf7d86ff78f02a4c887ec9edc.jpg"},{"name":"Frost Bite","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3381940/0a0a727dfdc309813ddd7c0900caa20621b25946.jpg"},{"name":"Cross Eyes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3381940/ae60b8fdc2f6ed2303b3b128f548c571d24b4058.jpg"},{"name":"Masker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3381940/4724aab36d53d940ed28c39142d155a2eb41da70.jpg"},{"name":"Slotted","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3381940/2ee4393f153d